his is not yet failing; it is a retirement risk. Next: check OpenAI's deprecated-models page for a retirement date and pick a non-deprecated replacement compatible with pydantic-ai-slim 1.x.","timestamp":1794361924577408063},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Commit e7724c60894: make verify exit 0, 2026-11-11 23:16 PST to 2026-11-12 00:32 PST (21129 passed, 29 skipped; integration 218 passed, 2 skipped). RED: test_the_openai_arm_pins_no_deprecated_model failed on the pre-fix overlay (trivial=gpt-5.4-nano); both new tests pass after. gpt-6-luna confirmed non-reasoning under the pinned profile (openai_supports_reasoning=False). Pushed as Gerrit 3365; the Live External Integration dispatch follows the merge.","timestamp":1794472402157117001},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit 3365 merged as 0fccb0f20aa (LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, 0 unresolved), submitted 2026-11-12 01:02 PST. Live External Integration dispatched on main at that SHA: run 43188089829 (2026-11-12 01:03 PST); waiting on its openai arm before closing.","timestamp":1794474236094738001},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Completion evidence:\n- Live dispatch: Live External Integration run 43188089829 on main at 0fccb0f20aa (dispatched 2026-11-12 01:03 PST, finished by 01:27 PST), conclusion success; job \"external LLM (live openai)\": success. Its usage-log artifact external-usage-log-openai attributes rows by model_class: trivial -> openai-responses:gpt-5.4-mini, 1 call, outcome ok; standard -> gpt-5.4-mini, 4 ok; frontier -> gpt-5.5, 33 ok; no failed rows. The trivial slot is identified by model_class, not by model id, so it is distinguished from standard.\n- Before the fix (run 42955953345) the same log showed trivial -> gpt-5.4-nano.\n- Gerrit 3365 merged as 0fccb0f20aa; make verify exit 0 on e7724c60894, 23:16-00:32 PST.\n- RED test: test_the_openai_arm_pins_no_deprecated_model failed pre-fix; the deprecated table lists both gpt-5.4-nano and its dated snapshot.","timestamp":1794475695737819001},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"HANDOFF STATE 2026-11-12 01:35 PST (session 3d705fec): CLOSED (class preexisting). Gerrit 3365 merged as 0fccb0f20aa; live run 43188089829 green with trivial on gpt-5.4-mini. Revisit gpt-6-luna on the pydantic-ai-slim 2.x upgrade; gpt-5.4-nano shuts down 2027-04-01.","timestamp":1794476118606420001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1794360672095819846,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"a8e10de6-a0a4-43c3-8473-7fbcf5e1088f","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"32ae-e4ae-b908-4e42"},{"link_uuid":"297269b5-4b0e-4aac-91c0-e47f4c6ed490","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"7090-016f-5b9e-4f31"},{"link_uuid":"8405d4cb-b7fc-407e-a907-84574c1c57b2","provenance":"derived","relation":"caused_by","target_id":"f124-f14a-fd62-4973"}],"description":"## Observation\n\n`.github/llm-providers/openai.toml` maps the openai arm's `trivial` class to `openai-responses:gpt-5.4-nano`. OpenAI's deprecations page (`https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations`, read 2026-11-11) lists `gpt-5.4-nano` / `gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17`, announced 2026-10-01, shutdown Apr 1, 2027, replacement `gpt-6-luna`. After shutdown every trivial-class call in the arm fails. `.github/llm-providers/README.md` and `docs/ci-provider-matrix.md` §\"OpenAI arm model choice\" still describe nano as the current trivial model.\n\n## Root cause\n\nThe overlay pins a model id with no check that it is still current; nothing in the tree records OpenAI's deprecation.\n\n## Choice of replacement\n\n**`gpt-5.4-mini`.**\n- It is not on the deprecations page and is listed on the catalogue; it is already the arm's `standard` model, verified on the repository's OpenAI account on 2026-08-03 and exercised by every openai arm run since.\n- The pinned `pydantic-ai-slim` 1.107.9 gives it the same OpenAI profile as `gpt-5.4-nano` (measured: `supports_json_schema_output`, `supports_thinking`, `openai_supports_reasoning`, `openai_supports_sampling_settings` all True, no unsupported settings), so the request shape is unchanged.\nRejected:\n- `gpt-6-luna`, OpenAI's named replacement: the pinned profile treats it as non-reasoning (`openai_supports_reasoning=False`, `supports_thinking=False`, measured), the same wrong-request-shape reason the docs already give for rejecting the GPT-6 family; recognition needs `pydantic-ai-slim` 2.x.\n- `gpt-5.5`: the frontier model; a trivial slot gains nothing from it.\n\n## Approach\n\n1. `.github/llm-providers/openai.toml`: `trivial = { model = \"openai-responses:gpt-5.4-mini\" }`; update the header comment.\n2. `docs/ci-provider-matrix.md` §\"OpenAI arm model choice\": record the 2026-11-11 move, the deprecation source and shutdown date, and the `gpt-6-luna` rejection; fix the estimate footnote's model list wording.\n3. `.github/llm-providers/README.md`: state the trivial slot's model.\n4. `tests/unit/test_ci_provider_matrix.py`: add the regression test below.\nNo config key, env var or flag.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `.github/llm-providers/openai.toml`\n- `.github/llm-providers/README.md`\n- `docs/ci-provider-matrix.md`\n- `tests/unit/test_ci_provider_matrix.py`\n\n## Testing\n\n- RED then GREEN: a test reads every class slot and the scalar model in `openai.toml` and asserts (a) none is an id OpenAI has announced as deprecated, from a module-level table citing the deprecations page (currently `gpt-5.4-nano`), and (b) each id's pinned `openai_model_profile` has `openai_supports_reasoning` True, so a non-reasoning-profiled replacement cannot slip in. It fails on the pre-fix tree on (a).\n- The existing `test_the_openai_arm_is_live_ready_with_its_own_credential` stays green.\n- After merge, dispatch `Live External Integration` on `main` and check the openai job's usage log shows `gpt-5.4-mini` trivial-class calls completing.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] A test that fails on the pre-fix tree rejects a deprecated id or a non-reasoning-profiled id in any openai overlay slot.\n- [x] `openai.toml`'s `trivial` slot is `openai-responses:gpt-5.4-mini`, and no tracked file names `gpt-5.4-nano` as a current model.\n- [x] `docs/ci-provider-matrix.md` records the replacement, its source and date, and the rejected `gpt-6-luna`.\n- [x] [non-codebase] A `Live External Integration` dispatch on `main` after the merge runs the openai arm with the new trivial model, recorded as a comment with the run id and the trivial-class call outcome.\n  provenance: environment=GitHub Actions Live External Integration on main; principal=repository OPENAI_API_KEY secret; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — workflow_dispatch run and its usage-log artifact\n- [x] [non-codebase] `env -u JIRA_URL -u JIRA_USER -u JIRA_API_TOKEN make verify` exits 0 on the commit pushed for review.\n  provenance: environment=macOS dev host, fix-tamarin worktree; principal=Rebar Bot Nava; privilege_posture=narrower; instrument=live-call — exit status and log live outside the repository\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":".github/llm-providers/openai.toml","reason":"trivial slot moves off deprecated gpt-5.4-nano"},{"path":".github/llm-providers/README.md","reason":"state the trivial slot model"},{"path":"docs/ci-provider-matrix.md","reason":"record the replacement and rejected gpt-6-luna"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_ci_provider_matrix.py","reason":"regression test on overlay model ids"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","7090-016f-5b9e-4f31"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"0fe2752f-15cc-41a3-ab20-8d82caf8492a","plan_